      "מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[3]=\\pi[4]=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> נובע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[3]=P[4]=a</annotation></semantics></math></span>, מ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[5]=2</annotation></semantics></math></span> נובע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[5]=P[2]=b</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ומ-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[6]=1</annotation></semantics></math></span> נובע <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[6]=P[1]=b</annotation></semantics></math></span>. כלומר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P=abaabb</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
