   "questionHtml": "האם קיימת מחרוזת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> מעל א\"ב <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>b</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\{a,b\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span> כך שפונקציה <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span> (prefix function) עבורה היא:<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>0</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>2</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">0,0,1,1,2,1</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>אם לא - נמקו מדוע לא קיימת. אם כן - תנו דוגמא למחרוזת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> מתאימה.",
   "solutionHtml": "<strong>פתרון רשמי</strong> (22B-A פתרון עמ' 1):<br>המחרוזת לא קיימת: נניח קיימת מחרוזת <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P</annotation></semantics></math></span> עם פונקציית <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi</annotation></semantics></math></span>: <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>001121</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">001121</annotation></semantics></math></span>. אז<br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⟹</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[1]=\\pi[2]=0\\Longrightarrow P[1]\\neq P[2]</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>ללא הגבלת כלליות נניח <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>⟹</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>3</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>⟹</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi><mtext> </mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>4</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">P[1]=a,\\ P[2]=b\\Longrightarrow P[3]=a\\ (\\pi[3]=1)\\Longrightarrow P[4]=a\\ (\\pi[4]=1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⟹</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[5]=2\\Longrightarrow P[5]=P[2]=b</annotation></semantics></math></span><br><span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>⟹</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>P</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[6]=1\\Longrightarrow P[6]=P[1]=a</annotation></semantics></math></span><br>אך אז יש רישא וסיפא <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">aba</annotation></semantics></math></span>, לכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>π</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mn>6</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\pi[6]=3</annotation></semantics></math></span> - סתירה.",
