      "האיבר ה-<span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">t</annotation></semantics></math></span> שמכוסה משלם לכל היותר <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mi>k</mi><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{k}{n-t+1}</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi mathvariant=\"script\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>k</mi><msubsup><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></msubsup><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mi>k</mi><mtext> </mtext><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\mathcal{T}|\\le k\\sum_{t=1}^{n}\\frac{1}{n-t+1}=k\\,H(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
