   "solutionHtml": "<strong>פתרון רשמי</strong> (24A-C פתרון עמ' 2):<pre class=\"code-block\" dir=\"ltr\"><code>Is_cut_vertex(G,x)\n  If deg(x)&lt;=1\n      return \"x is not cut\"\n  select v in N(x)\n  d[] = BSF(G-x,v)\n  for each u in N(x)\n      if d[u] = inf\n          return \"x is a cut\"\n  return \"x is not cut\"</code></pre>",
