      "כי <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mi>E</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo mathvariant=\"normal\">≠</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E|\\ne0</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ברכיב אחד לפחות יש יותר מקודקוד אחד, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>n</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mo>∑</mo><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>n</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n_1-1&gt;\\sum_i (n_i-1)</annotation></semantics></math></span>.",
      "זו סתירה לשוויון <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mrow><mi>D</mi><mi>F</mi><mi>S</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>G</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|E_{BFS(G,v)}|=|E_{DFS(G)}|</annotation></semantics></math></span>, ולכן <span class=\"math-inline\"><math dir=\"ltr\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>G</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">G</annotation></semantics></math></span> קשיר."
